Ver1.6
  - new sleep-idle-alert user service: cross-DE post-idle escalator with audio tiers and backlight flash
  - X11 idle detection via python3-xlib; Wayland via swayidle subprocess
  - on-battery anchored squawk ladder (gentle -> nag -> dumbass); plugging in or activity resets the ladder
  - per-tier curated filename lists via IDLE_SOUNDS_<TIER> (pipe-separated) take priority over
    tier subdirs and flat IDLE_SOUND_DIR; ships with the prior IdleAlert.sh per-device curation as defaults
  - falls back to sound-theme-freedesktop for built-in sounds when nothing else resolves
  - shipped udev rule grants the video group write on /sys/class/backlight/*/bl_power
  - idle alerter is optional at build time: `make WITH_IDLE_ALERTER=0 build` skips the script,
    user unit, udev rule, and python3-xlib/swayidle/sound-theme-freedesktop dependencies
  - sleep-idle-alert unit: WantedBy=default.target so it auto-starts on user
    login regardless of whether the compositor pulls graphical-session.target up
    (KDE/GNOME do; Hyprland/labwc/openbox typically don't); restart backoff
    (RestartSec=10s, StartLimitBurst=5/5min)
  - Makefile: new user-status / user-logs targets; VERSION 1.6

Ver1.5
  - sleep-power-control: skip CPU freq clamp when on AC, with 30s AC poll while screen is off
  - new sleep-cpu-governor service: drops to `powersave` below 20% battery, restores `schedutil` at >=25% (with hysteresis)
  - add Makefile wrapping build/install/clean/status/logs targets

Ver1.4
  - drop usage of `pyinstaller` (services are now shell wrappers, not compiled binaries)
  - replace inotify simple with inotify
  - source files extracted to `src/` - no longer inlined as heredocs
  - no need to build package as `root`
  - translate Korean to English in error message 
  - improve documentation
  - fixed logging (now the print statements appear in journal)
  - add CHANGES file

Ver1.3
  - autodetect path to power key

Ver1.2
  - Add customization (`/etc/uconsole-sleep/config`)
  - Power saving CPU freq now follows a user-specified value, not available value.

Ver1.1
  - Add feature hold power key to trigger `KEY_POWER` (interactive power menu)

Ver1.0
  - Official keyboard firmware detection
  - Apply timeout poll for desktop sleep mode detection
  - Use the `detect` flag instead of `on` forcing LCD turned on.

Ver0.3
  - Emit WakeUp Event after turn on screen
  - Add DRM control to turn off screen (BL,LCD) (not blank)

Ver0.2 
  - initial release
